      "source_line_sha256": "69c2a5f0416d91446dce51ed37ce162c11d657408eac046396b4d9bf2543b9ff",
      "source_text": "- execution mode: `STANDALONE`、`CLAUDE_ONLY`、`CODEX_ONLY`、`HYBRID`"
    },
    {
      "position": 27,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00112",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 147,
      "source_line_sha256": "fdddba824470aef47981ee905fb0326d17a18b045c99fcbdf06a03c59264af18",
      "source_text": "推測でroute identityを付与しない。曖昧入力はfail-closeする。旧`mode`／`model`／旧catalog routeは"
    },
    {
      "position": 28,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00114",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 149,
      "source_line_sha256": "737fadb31bc0e8995af774cf3ca6924fe2c13ac9ceb9f7f722c4382daac7e35c",
      "source_text": "DB authority、生成文書、PR契約へ再出力しない。全surfaceを無条件に`catalog_route_id`へ統一せず、"
    },
    {
      "position": 29,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00146",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 190,
      "source_line_sha256": "fd2893d0fd5b039cc78d1b5d5b8fabeb06fb82b260fa2fd943b89bea7ae7370f",
      "source_text": "boolean setとする。signalから条件、development style、execution formを推測しない。"
    },
    {
      "position": 30,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00147",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 192,
      "source_line_sha256": "14f2862d4146912c9ea3597db2f98d5f8ae8a54ca86feccd74a0ac2b0c13795b",
      "source_text": "出力receiptはclassification registry version、policy registry version、requirements／classification"
    },
    {
      "position": 31,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00150",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 195,
      "source_line_sha256": "9d0ce131d42fc8b7383e72f65bdfd90c2b7b56c32e2bbe687fd431d46cc10b7c",
      "source_text": "返す。登録済みcommandの`program`／`argv`は実行境界内部でcommand IDを再検証するために使い、routing"
    },
    {
      "position": 32,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00151",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 196,
      "source_line_sha256": "99bbc3f869d92ee67bc47e10970d5d90646c66a140966ceca08000fc5b98f989",
      "source_text": "receiptへraw invocationとして出力しない。旧`mode`／`model`／`catalog_route_id`／`route_class`／旧route"
    },
    {
      "position": 33,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00153",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 199,
      "source_line_sha256": "5cc06ff4b53d64ac032b97c0b0568affad76afb578868ce35c5298f6fb9b0250",
      "source_text": "dispositionは`resolved`、`classification_unknown`、`classification_decision_required`、"
    },
    {
      "position": 34,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00154",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 200,
      "source_line_sha256": "8be7a2dba730b811be9fc425c4bd359f8e1e88682e82faca17a2102ee0b46740",
      "source_text": "`classification_ambiguous`、`policy_unsupported`、`policy_ambiguous`、`approval_required`のexact setとする。"
    },
    {
      "position": 35,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00155",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 201,
      "source_line_sha256": "555145f953db107db0529f9745ce75dc86c0efd30118f9c5a352c5af3c87ef27",
      "source_text": "dispositionとprocess exitは次のexact mappingとし、consumerが名称類似でexit classを推測してはならない。"
    },
    {
      "position": 36,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00161",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 208,
      "source_line_sha256": "4015fa6eac84043ccc317efece12752bdc33985f21696829f78f1547dcae39ad",
      "source_text": "| `approval_required` | `blocked` | 1 |"
    },
    {
      "position": 37,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00163",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 210,
      "source_line_sha256": "df20ce5b71b549ad0ae03b751f993dbdf86b08a905e236b08dcbc491a3cd4be3",
      "source_text": "| `classification_decision_required` | `unresolved` | 2 |"
    },
    {
      "position": 38,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00165",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 213,
      "source_line_sha256": "9b30e1bcdba5ae2a758f6b3863b7c53c82757f6f08afbc5e317e53d85d15655a",
      "source_text": "`approval_policy: action_binding`は承認receiptが同一HEAD・同一policy digestへ束縛されるまで"
    },
    {
      "position": 39,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00167",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 215,
      "source_line_sha256": "a484c618300e2686cba4b69d74044911b2682140ebf9e1b9806f84e4bcd83e34",
      "source_text": "current consumer自体は受理しない。"
    },
    {
      "position": 40,
      "source_item_id": "REQSRC-SUP-00170",
      "source_path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/governance/helix-harness-requirements_v1.3.md",
      "source_file_sha256": "788636a30b5950b8d8d5f663018786e7071e4a06c4bb77688c5c9100e80a7406",
      "source_line": 220,
      "source_line_sha256": "89059e3905c61b3d13e0d7dcc9b81f5757a8fc1be2179119ed8f2ef9f7b4f252",
      "source_text": "exact contractから一方向変換する。実装内の独自表、名称類似、旧15-route inventoryから変換先を推測しない。"
    }
